C4  -> G4   perfect fifth, inverts to perfect fourth
E4  -> C5   minor sixth, inverts to major third
A3  -> C4   minor third, inverts to major sixth
F4  -> B4   tritone, inverts to tritone
D4  -> D5   octave, inverts to unison
C4  -> E5   compound major third (16 semitones), inverts to minor sixth
Bb3 -> Ab4  minor seventh, inverts to major second
G4  -> F#5  major seventh, inverts to minor second
